      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A substantial, well-presented two-storey family home situated on a large site at Cloonfane, Charlestown, Co. Mayo. \r\n\r\nThe property offers beautiful views of the surrounding countryside, generous living accommodation, excellent bedroom provision, a detached garage and attractive landscaped grounds.\r\n\r\nComing to the market in excellent condition throughout, the property comprises:\r\n\r\nGROUND FLOOR:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\r\nA large welcoming entrance hall featuring attractive grey laminate timber flooring, providing access to the principal living accommodation and staircase to the first floor. Also include understairs storage.\r\n\r\nSitting Room:\r\nA spacious reception room with timber flooring and a solid-fuel stove, creating a warm and comfortable family living space.\r\n\r\nLiving/Family Room:\r\nA generous second reception room with timber flooring and a solid-fuel stove with feature double doors leading to Kitchen/Dining room.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room:\r\nA fully fitted kitchen and dining room providing a practical and sociable heart to the home, with access towards the screened porch. Additionally, the dining room area includes patio door leading to the side of the house.\r\n\r\nUtility Room:\r\nA fitted utility room with timber flooring, providing useful additional storage and workspace.\r\n\r\nGuest WC:\r\nConveniently positioned on the ground floor and finished with half-tiled walls.\r\n\r\nScreened Porch:\r\nA large screened porch situated to the rear of the property provides a useful sheltered outdoor space and a pleasant connection between the house and garden.\r\n\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR:\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\r\nA spacious double bedroom with its own walk-in wardrobe and en-suite facilities.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\nA well-proportioned bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and en-suite facilities.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\r\nA generous bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and excellent natural light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4:\r\nA further spacious bedroom with walk-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nOffice:\r\nA small additional room suitable for use as a home office, study or hobby room\r\n\r\nMain Family Bathroom:\r\nA large, fully tiled family bathroom featuring a beautiful standalone bath together with a separate power shower.\r\n\r\nIn addition, the attic space has been floored, providing excellent storage space, while a Velux window allows ample natural light.\r\n\r\n\r\nEXTERNALLY:\r\nThe property occupies a large and attractive site.\r\n\r\nThe front entrance is approached through an electric entrance gate, with a substantial tarmac parking area providing generous parking area.\r\n\r\nTo the front of the site is an attractive stone boundary wall, complemented by mature planting and landscaped gardens and additional grounds.\r\n\r\nA detached garage provides valuable additional parking, storage or workshop space.\r\n\r\nThe surrounding countryside provides a lovely rural setting while the property itself is well established and private.\r\n\r\nENERGY & COMFORT\r\nThe house has a BER rating of B2 and benefits from a number of features designed to improve comfort and energy efficiency, including:\r\n•Solar panels \r\n•Oil-fired central heating (OFCH) \r\n•Full insulation \r\n•Well-insulated flooring \r\n\r\nThese features complement the spacious accommodation and make the property an appealing choice for modern family living.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n•Large site \r\n•Detached garage \r\n•Stone boundary wall \r\n•Electric entrance gate \r\n•Solar panels \r\n•Oil-fired central heating (OFCH) \r\n•Fully insulated \r\n•Well-insulated flooring \r\n•Screened porch to rear of house\r\n•Four spacious bedrooms \r\n•Two en-suite bedrooms \r\n•Walk-in wardrobes to all bedrooms \r\n•Small office \r\n•Large fully tiled family bathroom with Standalone bath & Separate power shower \r\n•Floored attic space for additional storage\r\n•Generous tarmac parking area \r\n•Landscaped gardens \r\n\r\n\r\nViewing & Further Information\r\nThis impressive detached family home offers spacious accommodation throughout, generous bedroom provision, excellent storage and a large private site. \r\n\r\nThe combination of its rural setting, substantial grounds, detached garage and range of modern energy-efficiency features makes this beautiful two storey residence an excellent family home and viewing is highly recommended by appointment only."
      },
